{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2016-11", "window": 3, "start_date": 1479254400, "end_date": 1479859199, "month_true_total": 663, "quota": 6, "returned": 6, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:12:21 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "26753318", "author": {"steamid": "76561198059727019", "personaname": "dyle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/excadrill/", "num_games_owned": 136, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 2397, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1202, "last_played": 1651954766, "avatar": "a3819bf55b30e7578e55a5826fb379be289247d6"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great fun either alone or with friends. 8/10", "timestamp_created": 1479850096, "timestamp_updated": 1479850096, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "26752998", "author": {"steamid": "76561198016974897", "personaname": "illusions mr. anderson", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/korlyfe/", "num_games_owned": 244, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 1894, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1522, "last_played": 1672158393, "avatar": "fbacc18a7b353df8de6f16b7c57c98000f7189e0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Enforcer all the way", "timestamp_created": 1479848797, "timestamp_updated": 1479848797, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "26740350", "author": {"steamid": "76561198080661269", "personaname": "rattle", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/rattlebones/", "num_games_owned": 1319, "num_reviews": 108, "playtime_forever": 2277, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1922, "last_played": 1689814933, "avatar": "900250ed0b2c59afa9853ba7725e4aef5b88daa3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Honestly one of the most fun games I've played in a while. It's pretty hard and I'm not good at it whatsoever, but I respect that it doesn't hold your hand throughout the levels. It throws you in and you're expected to fight for your life, making you improve over time and not just staying mediocre. The concept of the difficulty increasing overtime is unique (to my knowledge) and works very well, as it intices you to go fast but if you rush you won't be prepared in later levels. The pixel art is beatiful, I love the minimalistic style that the devs went for. The controls are fluent (some movement things can be annoying, but you just have to learn to use them), the characters all have their unique attributes along with the items. Artifacts add a lot of replayability as some can challenge you while others make it fun to run through.\n\nNot to mention it was made in GameMaker. Would love to see a new game by Hopoo.\n\n[b]9.5/10[/b]", "timestamp_created": 1479780277, "timestamp_updated": 1479948220, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.502487540245056152", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "26739078", "author": {"steamid": "76561198075418924", "personaname": "G33zm", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198075418924/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 3142, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2350, "last_played": 1514846441, "avatar": "142fda2bf804073f0f8439ce13d4dc51f0264b4a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game and couch coop you can grind through with your friends", "timestamp_created": 1479771504, "timestamp_updated": 1479771504, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "26736007", "author": {"steamid": "76561198135680330", "personaname": "AJS", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198135680330/", "num_games_owned": 168, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 456, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 291, "last_played": 1534846399, "avatar": "2f5cce860c3ae8493e03e383b455b843c15e06c7"}, "language": "english", "review": "great little side scroller you can put alot of time into it or a little and you'll still get lost in the game with the music and endless amount of bosses and colectables great game", "timestamp_created": 1479756404, "timestamp_updated": 1479766729, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "26734880", "author": {"steamid": "76561198089875755", "personaname": "Aks ♐", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SgtAks/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 2257, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2046, "last_played": 1554903329, "avatar": "20250adb0c39fe347b59d9754dcd35cf3f1efdc5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Brilliant game for killing time with runs ranging from 30 mins to however long you can survive. If you have *cough* friends *cough* grab them, it makes the game 10x more enjoyable, like most games. As for singleplayer, I can only compare it to TBOI; fun for a solid amount of time and unlocks to keep bringing you back for more. In conclusion, for £10, it's definately worth it to pick up.", "timestamp_created": 1479751956, "timestamp_updated": 1479751956, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}